# This repo standardizes on LF line endings for all text files, regardless
# of contributor OS/editor settings -- see CLAUDE.md "Key repo-wide
# conventions" and docs/development/README.md "Line endings".
#
# text=auto lets git auto-detect text vs. binary per file; eol=lf forces
# both the stored blob and the working-tree checkout to LF for anything
# git considers text, so a Windows checkout can't silently reintroduce CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly binary, as a backstop against auto-detection -- never touched
# for line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.FCStd binary
*.zip binary
*.step binary
*.stp binary
*.wrl binary
